WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
They are regular renters

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,360
So it’s really a lot of discounts

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,560
But if you rent for one month

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,720
Everyone's price is the same, right?

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,720
I'll make it cheaper for you

6
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,800
Eighty minutes a day

7
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,200
before negotiating price

8
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,040
Boss Xia, can you tell me your full name first, Xia Yan?

9
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:12,960
Boss Xia Yan

10
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,080
I can do the deal for seven or more pairs in one day.

11
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,520
There is also iced watermelon here. Which of you can eat it?

12
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:20,360
There are also oranges and bananas, can one come at a fraction of a third?

13
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,520
Give me two bananas. I ate too much tonight.

14
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,560
To help make you laugh, I want one too

15
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,680
I want three teeth watermelon

16
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,800
One orange and one banana

17
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,720
We don’t want it anymore

18
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:31,000
I ate too much at night and couldn't sleep

19
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,940
I want half a watermelon

20
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:38,100
Dig it in and eat it. Thank you boss.

21
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,020
Boss Xia

22
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,740
Give us two watermelons, please.

23
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,640
Bring me two more watermelons.

24
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,600
Really good

25
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,640
Just these three people today

26
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,240
I just earned a little over 405 points.

27
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:49,200
The total cost of the shop now is a little over seven thousand five hundred and twenty-two cents.

28
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:54,180
It should be very close to the upgrade.
